WEBVTT

00:00:00.507 --> 00:00:06.228
A grid places buy orders below the price

00:00:06.478 --> 00:00:08.546
and sell orders above it. When price crosses

00:00:08.546 --> 00:00:12.825
a line, that order fills. A liquidation line

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.795
sits beyond the range. The gap is the

00:00:17.795 --> 00:00:18.270
buffer. If the buffer shrinks, the plan is

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:18.370
under stress.
